<title>FRANCE: EU authorises preferential maize imports to Spain.</title>
<headline>EU authorises preferential maize imports to Spain.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted import tariff cuts of up to 59.82 Ecus per tonne for 189,000 tonnes of maize imports to Spain, member country officials said.</p>
<p>The tariff cuts are under a preferential trade agreement with the United States, dating from Spain's accession to the European trade bloc 10 years ago.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
